  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When I try to share invite+ link for event instance, they are not working.\n\nIt seems to be format of URL generated has wrong format.\n\nSite gives,\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_xxxxxxxxxxxxx&instanceId=33354~private(usr_yyyyyyyyyyyyyy)~canRequestInvite~region(us)~nonce(812df912-fed0-4866-8256-7d1ea0094186))\n\nbut it is not working.\n\nIf we change URL like,\n\n1. Remove ~canRequestInvite\n\n2.Change \"private(usr....\" to \"friends(usr....\"\n\nit seems start working and can use invite me to join instance.",
